stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> LAUNCHING: launch
    LAUNCHING --> READY: origin known<br/>AND listening
    READY --> IN_PROGRESS: first move
    IN_PROGRESS --> ENDED: game over
    CREATED --> CANCELLED: lobby cancels /<br/>waiting-room timeout
    LAUNCHING --> ABORTED: task fails to start
    READY --> CANCELLED: lobby cancels /<br/>waiting-room timeout
    IN_PROGRESS --> ABANDONED: idle timeout
    IN_PROGRESS --> ABORTED: task dies<br/>unexpectedly
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    ABORTED --> [*]
    ENDED --> [*]
    ABANDONED --> [*]
